  "text": "Quantifiable outcomes such as measurable premium reductions or coverage expansions have not been published. However, HIP has achieved institutionalization and scope growth, with increasing participation from major reinsurers. It has also aligned policy with mitigation funding through the DRF, and there is a commitment to improving consumer clarity regarding hazard coverage.",
